OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly rain in the east quickly
OL,6,Fclearing, leaving a morning of
OL,7,Fsunshine and a scattering of showers,
OL,8,Fmainly in the west. The showers
OL,9,Fbecoming more widespread throughout
OL,10,Fthe afternoon, potentially turning
OL,11,Fheavy in places. Feeling warm in the
OL,12,Fsunshine.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FA continuation of clear
OL,15,Fspells and scattered showers this
OL,16,Fevening. The showers becoming mainly
OL,17,Fconfined to western areas overnight. A
OL,18,Fcooler night than last night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
