OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA largely dry and bright day
OL,6,Ffor many with sunny spells. A few
OL,7,Fshowers possible, mainly towards the
OL,8,Fwest. Temperatures nearer average.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry
OL,11,Fstart Friday but outbreaks of rain
OL,12,Flikely later. Rain clears overnight
OL,13,Fleaving a largely dry and bright
OL,14,Fweekend, with sunny spells, although
OL,15,Fsome nighttime fog possible.
OL,16,FTemperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
